WEBVTT

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:16.040
Hey, where are we going?

00:00:17.980 --> 00:00:20.670
Don't tell me he's going to throw me into boiling hot oil.

00:00:20.670 --> 00:00:23.540
No... Maybe he'll push me off a cliff.

00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:27.670
Excuse me, maid-san.

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:30.090
Is it possible for me to use the washroom?

00:00:30.420 --> 00:00:32.090
I'll take that chance and escape.

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:35.080
Ah, your bladder is full?

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:37.480
I will clean up afterwards,

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:39.350
so please feel free to relieve yourself here.

00:00:48.860 --> 00:00:50.180
What?!

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:53.820
I didn't bring you here to torture you.

00:00:55.010 --> 00:00:56.940
Be relieved.

00:01:10.760 --> 00:01:12.770
A dojo?!

00:01:12.770 --> 00:01:15.110
The weapons are over there.

00:01:15.110 --> 00:01:16.010
Weapons?!

00:01:16.010 --> 00:01:18.510
You can pick whatever you want.

00:01:18.510 --> 00:01:21.290
I don't mind bare hands, either.

00:01:21.290 --> 00:01:22.310
Wait a minute.

00:01:22.310 --> 00:01:23.680
You can't possibly mean...

00:01:25.650 --> 00:01:28.900
Let's find out...

00:01:31.350 --> 00:01:34.280
...who is qualified to protect Rea.

00:03:18.050 --> 00:03:20.970
Looks like I'll be paid well today.

00:03:26.760 --> 00:03:29.100
Welcome home, Ojou-sama.

00:03:32.310 --> 00:03:34.020
Father...

00:03:34.020 --> 00:03:35.400
Please call my father...

00:03:35.400 --> 00:03:37.480
I am truly sorry...

00:03:37.480 --> 00:03:40.860
Danichirou-sama is currently busy.

00:03:41.200 --> 00:03:43.160
Furuya-kun is here as well, isn't he?

00:03:43.160 --> 00:03:45.620
I am going to where my father is.

00:03:45.620 --> 00:03:47.200
We cannot allow it.

00:03:47.200 --> 00:03:52.120
Rea-sama should relax for the time being.

00:03:57.460 --> 00:03:58.710
Pardon the intrusion.

00:04:04.760 --> 00:04:08.560
Aria-sama, Rea-sama has been taken into custody.

00:04:09.390 --> 00:04:10.850
I see.

00:04:10.850 --> 00:04:12.640
Would you like to see her?

00:04:13.600 --> 00:04:15.150
Why should I?

00:04:16.270 --> 00:04:19.150
Why should I go and see that girl?

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:25.780
What is it?

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:28.080
Why am I... being treated like this?

00:04:28.620 --> 00:04:30.700
I am truly sorry.

00:04:30.700 --> 00:04:33.040
This is Danichirou-sama's order.

00:04:33.370 --> 00:04:35.370
In that case, I will order you, too.

00:04:35.370 --> 00:04:37.130
Take this off right now.

00:04:37.130 --> 00:04:41.670
Rea-sama put up such a scary face and is giving us orders.

00:04:41.670 --> 00:04:47.180
To think you'd change so much after
leaving the house for only a few days.

00:04:49.720 --> 00:04:51.770
This cannot be allowed.

00:04:51.770 --> 00:04:54.850
We'll keep this hidden from Danichirou-sama,

00:04:54.850 --> 00:04:57.350
but wouldn't it be good to give you a little punishment?

00:04:57.350 --> 00:04:58.810
That is a good idea.

00:04:58.810 --> 00:05:01.190
It will be hard to come across another chance like this.

00:05:02.320 --> 00:05:03.360
What?!

00:05:03.360 --> 00:05:04.400
What are you going to do?

00:05:05.530 --> 00:05:06.570
N-No.

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:19.210
So cute!

00:05:19.210 --> 00:05:21.250
What is this?

00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:22.880
What is with this outfit?

00:05:22.880 --> 00:05:26.550
I've always wanted to see Rea-sama try this on.

00:05:26.550 --> 00:05:28.930
I thought it would fit her perfectly.

00:05:30.010 --> 00:05:31.310
You cowards...

00:05:31.310 --> 00:05:34.600
To tie me up and force me into this embarrassing outfit,

00:05:34.600 --> 00:05:35.640
how shameful!

00:05:38.900 --> 00:05:42.110
Rea-sama is super cute when she is embarrassed!

00:05:42.110 --> 00:05:43.900
After that, what should we make her wear?

00:05:43.900 --> 00:05:44.690
Female ninja outfit?

00:05:44.690 --> 00:05:45.440
Cartoon-character costume?

00:05:46.700 --> 00:05:49.200
No way...

00:05:49.200 --> 00:05:51.530
I don't have time to be doing this.

00:05:52.740 --> 00:05:55.330
I have a bad feeling... Furuya-kun.

00:05:57.500 --> 00:05:58.790
Furuya-kun!

00:06:05.840 --> 00:06:06.920
What's wrong?!

00:06:07.550 --> 00:06:13.600
I said, if you land one hit on me, it will be your victory.

00:06:14.600 --> 00:06:16.600
Isn't this unfair?

00:06:16.600 --> 00:06:18.690
I don't know anything about fencing.

00:06:19.020 --> 00:06:23.230
Then feel free to use whatever sword style or martial arts moves you know well.

00:06:23.230 --> 00:06:25.440
I don't know how to do any of that.

00:06:25.730 --> 00:06:26.690
What?

00:06:26.690 --> 00:06:28.490
What a pathetic, weak guy!

00:06:28.490 --> 00:06:32.030
Are you saying you don't even know basic self-defence?

00:06:32.030 --> 00:06:38.460
Why does Rea go to you, a guy without any skills or talents?

00:06:40.120 --> 00:06:41.960
You don't even know such a simple thing.

00:06:43.380 --> 00:06:47.920
You don't even know that...

00:06:51.430 --> 00:06:53.510
That works. It works perfectly!

00:06:53.510 --> 00:06:56.520
Super cute.

00:06:58.140 --> 00:06:59.440
You guys...

00:06:59.440 --> 00:07:00.230
Untie me!

00:07:00.640 --> 00:07:01.770
I told you...

00:07:01.770 --> 00:07:04.770
We can't do anything against his orders.

00:07:04.770 --> 00:07:06.110
We cannot.

00:07:08.570 --> 00:07:10.740
Next should be a female ninja outfit , right?

00:07:10.740 --> 00:07:13.370
Then you've got to let me do the
cartoon-character costume after that.

00:07:13.370 --> 00:07:16.120
What should we do?

00:07:16.120 --> 00:07:18.120
Eh?! Aren't we doing this in order?

00:07:18.120 --> 00:07:19.750
What should we do?

00:07:19.750 --> 00:07:21.670
I won't... wear either of them.

00:07:21.670 --> 00:07:22.170
Eh?

00:07:23.960 --> 00:07:25.250
I...

00:07:26.460 --> 00:07:27.920
...have to get going.

00:07:30.880 --> 00:07:33.720
I think so, too.

00:07:33.720 --> 00:07:36.010
Oh yes... yes.

00:07:36.470 --> 00:07:38.810
What are you trying to say?

00:07:38.810 --> 00:07:41.140
Basically,

00:07:41.600 --> 00:07:42.390
it's disgusting.

00:07:43.190 --> 00:07:43.980
What?!

00:07:43.980 --> 00:07:46.770
Let's settle it in a one-on-one fight?

00:07:46.770 --> 00:07:48.070
What is that?

00:07:48.070 --> 00:07:52.150
Ignoring Rea's feelings, saying she will belong to the winner...

00:07:52.150 --> 00:07:54.820
Heck, it's pretty self-centred to think you can just...

00:07:54.820 --> 00:07:57.870
...drag me here and spout stuff like that.

00:07:58.580 --> 00:08:03.120
Besides that, that habit of taking nude
pictures of your daughter on her birthday...

00:08:04.500 --> 00:08:06.420
You bastard, how do you...

00:08:06.420 --> 00:08:08.340
That's way too crazy, right?

00:08:08.340 --> 00:08:10.760
That's far from normal parental love.

00:08:11.130 --> 00:08:16.930
Of course anyone would want to run away from such a disgusting father.

00:08:24.560 --> 00:08:25.900
Furuya-kun.

00:08:27.520 --> 00:08:30.110
Therefore, put aside your nonsense...

00:08:30.650 --> 00:08:34.150
...about who is going to protect Rea or the level of our skill.

00:08:34.150 --> 00:08:36.870
More importantly, it should be about what Rea wants to do, right?

00:08:37.530 --> 00:08:41.870
There's nothing good about making decisions for her without letting her have a say in it.

00:08:42.540 --> 00:08:44.750
Doing that in itself is abnormal.

00:08:44.750 --> 00:08:47.080
In the first place, you say you want to protect Rea.

00:08:47.080 --> 00:08:51.380
But, in reality, isn't it that you just don't want to let her go?

00:08:51.750 --> 00:08:53.380
I heard it all from that mother.

00:08:54.090 --> 00:08:56.180
I think Rea is in a lot of pain.

00:08:56.180 --> 00:09:00.890
You continue to try and hide her in the shadow of your dead wife.

00:09:04.020 --> 00:09:04.890
Therefore...

00:09:12.030 --> 00:09:13.820
Furuya...

00:09:13.820 --> 00:09:16.820
It seems you have underestimated me.

00:09:19.740 --> 00:09:21.610
With the power of the Sanka Family,

00:09:21.610 --> 00:09:26.330
your insignificant existence can easily be erased.

00:09:26.960 --> 00:09:29.330
Isn't that true, Rea?

00:09:30.790 --> 00:09:32.130
Furuya-kun.

00:09:37.220 --> 00:09:39.180
H-He stabbed him!

00:09:42.180 --> 00:09:44.220
What's wrong, Furuya?

00:09:44.220 --> 00:09:47.310
Did you think I wouldn't stab you?

00:10:02.830 --> 00:10:04.910
What the hell?!

00:10:05.500 --> 00:10:07.920
That makes us even.

00:10:08.450 --> 00:10:10.330
Furuya-kun...

00:10:10.700 --> 00:10:12.990
Huh? Rea?

00:10:12.990 --> 00:10:14.840
What are you doing here?

00:10:15.300 --> 00:10:18.220
H-Hey, that costume!

00:10:19.930 --> 00:10:22.930
I've never seen a combination like that!

00:10:24.600 --> 00:10:26.270
It's an even match to the nurse zombie girl!

00:10:26.270 --> 00:10:28.600
No, it's even more moe!

00:10:29.230 --> 00:10:32.690
T-The head maid made me wear it...

00:10:33.570 --> 00:10:35.860
F-Furuya-kun, you're bleeding!

00:10:36.440 --> 00:10:38.360
Eh?

00:10:38.360 --> 00:10:40.780
Furuya!

00:10:40.780 --> 00:10:43.780
How did you just shrug that off?!

00:10:44.450 --> 00:10:47.410
Huh... I wonder.

00:10:48.040 --> 00:10:50.620
I don't really understand it myself.

00:10:50.620 --> 00:10:53.710
Maybe I became so excited that my body started to release adrenaline?

00:10:53.710 --> 00:10:55.170
Or maybe...

00:10:57.510 --> 00:10:58.760
Surely not?!

00:10:59.380 --> 00:11:03.930
When Rea licked my wounds...

00:11:06.640 --> 00:11:11.690
It seems like I've been infected by Rea's poison.

00:11:11.690 --> 00:11:13.160
Poison?

00:11:13.160 --> 00:11:14.270
Infected?

00:11:15.520 --> 00:11:20.280
My pain receptors have been paralysed,

00:11:20.280 --> 00:11:23.990
but I guess the fact that my heart is still beating means I didn't take a fatal dose.

00:11:23.990 --> 00:11:26.240
Which means, that for the time being,

00:11:29.870 --> 00:11:32.290
I'm a half-zombie.

00:11:34.380 --> 00:11:37.050
A zombie?

00:11:38.630 --> 00:11:40.300
Then...

00:11:42.260 --> 00:11:44.680
...I'll just have to behead you!

00:11:59.320 --> 00:12:03.950
Please stop this, Father.

00:12:05.280 --> 00:12:08.370
The fight was over with your last blow.

00:12:09.330 --> 00:12:12.080
If you insist on continuing to fight,

00:12:13.210 --> 00:12:15.080
then I shall be your opponent!

00:12:17.250 --> 00:12:19.840
What are you saying, Rea?

00:12:20.210 --> 00:12:24.680
I only want to save you.

00:12:25.510 --> 00:12:33.190
I only wish to cure your mysterious illness.

00:12:33.980 --> 00:12:36.560
Let's move to America together.

00:12:36.560 --> 00:12:39.190
I've already made the travel arrangements.

00:12:40.940 --> 00:12:46.410
If we consult the many excellent doctors from all over the world, then maybe...

00:12:46.410 --> 00:12:49.910
No, we'll definitely find a cure.

00:12:50.620 --> 00:12:53.660
Do you really think this boy can save you?

00:12:54.250 --> 00:12:59.420
How much can a boy with limited wealth and knowledge really do?

00:13:02.670 --> 00:13:04.420
You've got it wrong, Father.

00:13:06.720 --> 00:13:11.390
I don't mind if we don't find a cure.

00:13:12.810 --> 00:13:14.290
What?

00:13:14.290 --> 00:13:18.810
But if we don't, then your body will...

00:13:18.810 --> 00:13:22.150
If finding a cure means leaving this town,

00:13:22.150 --> 00:13:24.030
then it's fine for things to stay as they are.

00:13:25.780 --> 00:13:28.490
Even if our time together is short,

00:13:28.490 --> 00:13:34.040
it's enough for me to be here with Furuya-kun.

00:13:34.410 --> 00:13:35.910
Rea...

00:13:36.830 --> 00:13:38.880
Why?

00:13:40.500 --> 00:13:47.300
What is so good about this little bit of freedom if it will be short lived?

00:13:47.680 --> 00:13:52.560
You're such a special and noble being...

00:13:59.400 --> 00:14:01.940
Don't you get it yet, Father?!

00:14:02.480 --> 00:14:03.610
Fath-

00:14:03.610 --> 00:14:06.820
Being special isn't what Rea actually wants!

00:14:08.360 --> 00:14:12.450
How often have you really given Rea what she wanted?!

00:14:12.450 --> 00:14:15.080
And not just telling her what she should want!

00:14:17.620 --> 00:14:19.830
Father!

00:14:20.750 --> 00:14:24.000
I found a snail in the garden!

00:14:29.430 --> 00:14:31.440
Listen, Rea.

00:14:31.440 --> 00:14:35.010
You shouldn't touch such dirty things.

00:14:40.730 --> 00:14:44.400
I want to go shopping with my friends.

00:14:44.400 --> 00:14:45.940
You don't need to worry about that.

00:14:45.940 --> 00:14:48.900
I'll buy you whatever you want.

00:14:48.900 --> 00:14:50.860
What would you like?

00:14:52.820 --> 00:14:55.370
Rea's a high school student now.

00:14:55.870 --> 00:15:00.830
We must ensure that no vulgar boys get close to her.

00:15:00.830 --> 00:15:05.460
There are only one set of genes good enough for Rea.

00:15:10.880 --> 00:15:16.430
Rea just wants to be a normal girl!

00:15:26.900 --> 00:15:29.150
Just for that...

00:15:30.280 --> 00:15:32.980
You're telling me...

00:15:32.980 --> 00:15:35.660
...you died just for that?

00:15:37.870 --> 00:15:41.080
It's all my fault.

00:15:42.330 --> 00:15:44.080
It's all my...

00:15:50.510 --> 00:15:55.100
Though, I do agree with a part of what you said.

00:15:57.390 --> 00:16:03.810
It's true that there might be times when I can't help her on my own.

00:16:03.810 --> 00:16:08.860
So I want you to help me when that happens.

00:16:09.730 --> 00:16:13.530
Because I always want to have her here with me.

00:16:14.110 --> 00:16:16.120
Furuya-kun...

00:16:28.090 --> 00:16:29.130
Rea...

00:16:31.090 --> 00:16:33.630
...you really won't regret this?

00:16:35.510 --> 00:16:36.640
No.

00:16:41.310 --> 00:16:42.640
Very well.

00:16:43.830 --> 00:16:44.770
Furuya.

00:16:49.360 --> 00:16:51.610
I entrust my daughter to you.

00:16:52.570 --> 00:16:53.610
Old man...

00:16:54.700 --> 00:16:56.030
Father...

00:17:00.790 --> 00:17:07.250
However, it's only while I search overseas for a cure for Rea.

00:17:07.250 --> 00:17:09.500
I'm not handing her over forever.

00:17:10.380 --> 00:17:11.670
Fine.

00:17:11.670 --> 00:17:12.920
And...

00:17:15.220 --> 00:17:19.510
Don't think that this gives you an excuse to take her virginity.

00:17:27.900 --> 00:17:30.070
Like I'd be thinking that!

00:17:30.070 --> 00:17:31.980
What did he say to you?

00:17:31.980 --> 00:17:34.190
N-Nothing!

00:17:34.190 --> 00:17:36.200
It's not like that!

00:17:38.110 --> 00:17:41.490
But, I guess it's fine...

00:17:41.490 --> 00:17:43.700
For now...

00:17:45.460 --> 00:17:49.630
...I'll be able to live with Rea agai-

00:17:53.270 --> 00:17:53.920
Furuya-kun?

00:17:54.550 --> 00:17:56.170
Furuya-kun?

00:17:56.170 --> 00:17:57.470
Furuya-kun!

00:17:57.930 --> 00:17:59.970
No!

00:18:04.930 --> 00:18:06.100
Would you like a drink?

00:18:06.100 --> 00:18:06.730
No.

00:18:33.420 --> 00:18:35.090
Thank goodness!

00:18:37.720 --> 00:18:38.590
Sorry!

00:18:42.930 --> 00:18:43.650
Huh?

00:18:43.650 --> 00:18:45.470
My sense of pain has returned..

00:18:46.350 --> 00:18:47.390
I see.

00:18:47.390 --> 00:18:50.060
Then the poison in my body must be gone!

00:18:50.060 --> 00:18:52.110
Damn, that hurts!

00:18:52.110 --> 00:18:55.230
We've treated your wounds.

00:18:55.230 --> 00:18:57.610
Seems like you've returned from the dead.

00:18:58.030 --> 00:18:59.860
Hey, I was never dead!

00:19:01.570 --> 00:19:03.410
Anyway, I'm so glad you're okay!

00:19:03.410 --> 00:19:05.180
You had lost so much blood...

00:19:05.180 --> 00:19:07.950
I thought you might never wake up...

00:19:07.950 --> 00:19:11.370
I guess so... I must have worried you. Sorry.

00:19:12.710 --> 00:19:13.880
Not at all.

00:19:17.460 --> 00:19:19.800
Hey, that costume.

00:19:20.260 --> 00:19:26.390
The maids all told me you'd really like it...

00:19:27.560 --> 00:19:29.980
Is it no good?

00:19:29.980 --> 00:19:34.480
A nurse zombie! Superb!

00:19:34.860 --> 00:19:37.360
Nii can't stand up to something like that...

00:19:37.970 --> 00:19:39.610
Chihiro!

00:19:40.150 --> 00:19:40.820
Wanko.

00:19:41.400 --> 00:19:43.410
You stupid idiot!

00:19:43.820 --> 00:19:46.910
I came running as soon as Mero-chan told me you were hurt!

00:19:46.910 --> 00:19:50.040
If you know I'm hurt, then don't jump on me!

00:19:50.040 --> 00:19:51.870
Ah, sorry.

00:19:51.870 --> 00:19:54.420
Anyway, what happened?

00:19:54.420 --> 00:19:56.340
W-Well...

00:19:59.010 --> 00:20:00.840
I-I'm sorry.

00:20:00.840 --> 00:20:03.930
This is all my fault...

00:20:04.430 --> 00:20:05.110
Huh?

00:20:05.110 --> 00:20:06.890
Why the nurse outfit?

00:20:06.890 --> 00:20:09.890
They told me Furuya-kun would like it.

00:20:09.890 --> 00:20:12.730
Hey, what are you making her do, you perv!

00:20:12.730 --> 00:20:14.440
I didn't make her wear it!

00:20:14.440 --> 00:20:16.190
But you liked it.

00:20:16.190 --> 00:20:17.440
I sure di-

00:20:17.440 --> 00:20:18.940
Hey, what are you making me say?!

00:20:18.940 --> 00:20:20.320
Huh...

00:20:20.320 --> 00:20:24.910
Anyway, Furuya-kun ended up like this because of me.

00:20:24.910 --> 00:20:26.700
Rea, you don't need t-

00:20:31.580 --> 00:20:33.370
Sanka-san, right?

00:20:33.370 --> 00:20:35.920
So you're the zombie who's staying here?

00:20:35.920 --> 00:20:37.710
Y-Yes...

00:20:40.380 --> 00:20:43.220
Oh, I didn't introduce myself, did I?

00:20:44.260 --> 00:20:47.470
I'm Saoji Ranko. I'm a year older than you.

00:20:49.180 --> 00:20:50.220
Pleased to meet you.

00:20:50.680 --> 00:20:52.980
I'm like a big sister to Chihiro, and I'm his fiancée!

00:20:54.230 --> 00:20:56.560
His human fiancée, of course.

00:20:59.940 --> 00:21:03.240
You understand that that was a joke, right?!

00:21:03.240 --> 00:21:06.870
Hey, Ranko... san... Don't go saying stuff like that.

00:21:06.870 --> 00:21:07.910
Huh?

00:21:07.910 --> 00:21:11.240
But you promised me back in primary school.

00:21:12.620 --> 00:21:13.330
Chihiro!

00:21:13.830 --> 00:21:15.500
What?

00:21:15.500 --> 00:21:17.670
Be my fiancée!

00:21:17.670 --> 00:21:18.790
What's that?

00:21:19.340 --> 00:21:19.970
Who cares.

00:21:19.970 --> 00:21:20.800
Just be my fiancée!

00:21:22.340 --> 00:21:23.800
Okay then...

00:21:24.670 --> 00:21:27.550
Like I'd remember some random thing we said back then!

00:21:28.220 --> 00:21:29.100
Just kidding.

00:21:29.430 --> 00:21:31.260
Sorry, Sanka-san.

00:21:31.260 --> 00:21:32.720
But did you see that?

00:21:32.720 --> 00:21:35.630
He's cute when he gets nervous, isn't he?

00:21:35.630 --> 00:21:36.390
Shut up!

00:21:36.390 --> 00:21:38.610
You were basically crying just a second ago!

00:21:39.360 --> 00:21:40.820
I was faking it.

00:21:40.820 --> 00:21:43.690
Yeah right. Besides, I was faking too.

00:21:43.690 --> 00:21:46.070
Then it wasn't a very good performance.

00:21:46.070 --> 00:21:46.950
Though you know...

00:21:48.450 --> 00:21:51.660
How about you tell me the whole story?

00:21:51.660 --> 00:21:53.790
Maybe if you let me go.

00:21:53.790 --> 00:21:54.950
Afraid I can't do that!

00:21:54.950 --> 00:21:55.960
I see...
Afraid I can't do that!

00:21:56.410 --> 00:21:57.540
This girl...

00:21:58.210 --> 00:22:03.000
...likes Furuya-kun.

00:23:42.650 --> 00:23:43.810
Is that so?

00:23:44.270 --> 00:23:46.570
Mero-chan has stopped...

00:23:46.570 --> 00:23:47.900
It can't be helped.

00:23:47.900 --> 00:23:49.650
She is still a child.

00:23:50.900 --> 00:23:51.910
Let's go.

00:23:51.910 --> 00:23:52.950
Okay.

00:23:52.950 --> 00:23:54.450
Next time, Sankarea.

00:23:54.450 --> 00:23:58.160
Episode 12: That moment... I...

00:23:58.910 --> 00:24:00.710
Everyone, you better watch it! Mero~

00:24:00.710 --> 00:24:01.710
Mero!

00:24:01.710 --> 00:24:03.210
Mero-chan!

00:24:05.210 --> 00:24:07.710
I will no longer run away.
